9", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499314641_2334058800454382_6810420958056556067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kIWXcOKnj4YQ7kNvwGkp7kD&_nc_oc=AdqyW_urkStqMoaIbitPmdYCxQTlHvzc_LwHpc0QpD-WiDq-fyhNP7_E8XiU9TA6YNQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQndoCUths3jOT8YF75EwlzignhL9Bn4Ju8jdsC7i2eKw&oe=6AF9B4DB"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203353.png", "id": "1290753326156435", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312236_1290753329489768_4332884711738293422_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cMQeAWIUxvAQ7kNvwH3nv4Y&_nc_oc=AdrfOudnT7VTbSs7dtCO1gmLom8lYoiRN2Dav42yzXVTq4vnPxZRYTpwZa11vQDNKLA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQewhwn-6kX87EcAgs3ol_QmyFET-s-QSG-DEVaIEcrPA&oe=6AF9B481"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203201.png", "id": "1926405484733596", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312338_1926405491400262_5342535590335345652_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KADxt48z558Q7kNvwEiSGiX&_nc_oc=AdoXImZkulmUlsWYg2V83RTBwKuIfrlWADQeE7HvGz-hZqMNPK0QsI4degDJBxLRYNc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQzqjpQ73G1uwYpujXxDscyKQ5ALw3wB6HBQ2jOfpDL2Q&oe=6AF9D89D"}, {"file_name": "com.onenightcircus.fields-20251218-203301.png", "id": "974613512240519", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312470_974613515573852_1573452143751525995_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cJhWYYx2SzkQ7kNvwGeqFwF&_nc_oc=AdpGwBk-kZFyvTQbV48KDb3fShcRes9MNVKiyUCErkkP0jU_NMEr1ion7hqjKv9iuvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSlFW8QY75ry3fQNPjWAO_dhj-H5g2iiBl7WGNQS7-kiw&oe=6AF9DA7F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "fields-artwork-v2-2560x1440.png", "id": "1690141432030718", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1690141435364051_2132099073325899983_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=of7d2y1yPhAQ7kNvwFxTvbL&_nc_oc=AdqIxLC061AZHWeHX-w1Qr_7lT7BLANkpWrQ6shJgTs_NEwTSvFbXRMqVLeKYmb0aZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT4QPbwer72MqT-dUlxUxBPm3Q8F83u-N0hOVZBlYrFIw&oe=6AF9CEEE"}, "display_name": "Fields", "keywords": ["music", "inmersive", "art", "visuals", "meditation"], "long_description": "Fields is not an album you listen to. It is a place you enter.\n\nAn immersive VR experience built around the music of electronic producer Die Stadt, Fields dissolves the boundary between sound and space. Each track becomes an environment: shifting fields of light, generative textures, and slow chromatic movements that respond to the music in real time.\n\nFields is designed for deep listening \u2014 a rare kind of attention that VR makes possible. No narrative, no objectives. Only presence.\nWhat you will find inside:\n\n- A full-length electronic music album experienced as a living, breathing space.\n- Generative visuals that evolve with the music.\n- Designed for extended, contemplative sessions.\n- Optimized for Meta Quest 3.\n\nFields is an album. Fields is a place. Now you can enter both.\n\nStep in.\n{1548057873348580}", "short_description": "Step inside the music of electronic/ambient producer Die Stadt. Sound becomes space. Space becomes music."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "uba_APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE.png", "id": "2273186383217800", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307451_2273186386551133_8686410893456982869_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Bt5npz_Lwq4Q7kNvwGV8gd8&_nc_oc=AdprWRJGO1e9ZGTBhC9JvD8DX_uwAZCGCPzQ0Cm3p0xOoKa5qpBl79SbwtswH-MT9gE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRIPK5wYzEY08mUxXG-Eji-6jRTXEswkczhjvIUZZs0HA&oe=6AF9C7DF"}, {"file_name": "fields_logotipo_512x512.png", "id": "2080711572861858", "image_type": "APP_IMG_L